{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22493","headline":"衰病无趣因吟所怀 · 白居易","name":"衰病无趣因吟所怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朝餐多不饱，夜卧常少睡。\n自觉寝食间，多无少年味。\n平生好诗酒，今亦将舍弃。\n酒唯下药饮，无复曾欢醉。\n诗多听人吟，自不题一字。\n病姿与衰相，日夜相继至。\n况当尚少朝，弥慙居近侍。\n终当求一郡，聚少渔樵费。\n合口便归山，不问人间事。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22493.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22493","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}